Public headers include hyprutils (-> pixman.h), libdrm (drm_fourcc.h lives in
/usr/include/libdrm) and wayland-client, but aquamarine.pc declares no
Requires, so consumers using only `pkg-config aquamarine` miss those include
paths.

--- a/aquamarine.pc.in
+++ b/aquamarine.pc.in
@@ -6,5 +6,6 @@
 URL: https://github.com/hyprwm/aquamarine
 Description: A very light linux rendering backend library
 Version: @AQUAMARINE_VERSION@
+Requires: hyprutils, libdrm, wayland-client
 Cflags: -I${includedir}
 Libs: -L${libdir} -laquamarine
